{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TMNDPex6ST1793463019.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>部分旅客提早乘跨境巴士回內地。</p><p></p><p>在太子跨境直通巴巴士站，有旅客排隊等車前往皇崗口岸，未見大排長龍。職員在場協助。警方亦架設排隊區，供旅客候車。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BUS-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026H4IjABG4Lr1793463034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有旅客說由於人太多，無法進入蘭桂坊，想早點回家休息。</p><p></p><p>深圳旅客林小姐說：「因為繞不到去蘭桂坊，封路了，沒有指示，繞了很大一圈都找不到，繞了一個小時多、兩小時吧。對，就算了吧，有緣無份，中環去了就算了吧，因為也很累了。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BUS 2300 + BITE 2300._001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wDVm3zlEsh1793463605.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>廣州旅客程先生稱：「因為我們現在趕車，要回去深圳，我們是要回廣州的。」</p><p></p><p>記者問：「為甚麼不在蘭桂坊喝點酒？」</p><p></p><p>程先生回答：「因為蘭桂坊太熱鬧，只有單行，而且會趕人，走一波，玩一下便要走，不能長時間停留。」</p><p></p><p>深圳旅客李小姐表示：「我們已經玩了一整天，我們去的是海洋公園，就是一會兒可能人比較多，我們是一起的，想早點回去。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BUS 2300 + BITE 2300._002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202668X5jDyPrB1793463623.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:34.776822+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T15:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.251953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.251953+00:00","content_hash":"5689c9ec4db652d953c01c59c52ad1122bd9b1df47785f2e17c6aff1d2ccbdc7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}